      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.newhavenmi.org/residents/about_new_haven/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 30‑year contract in 1897 gave a local inventor the right to light New Haven’s streets, alleys, and grounds from a dynamo in the Old Power House.",
